'' The line continuation discards the rest of its physical line, which is what a
'' continuation inside a macro argument list depends on.
'' ...EXCEPT NEXT TO A PASTE. 'V##_' is the NAME 'Foo_' and fbc reads it as one --
'' measured, fbc emits '_Z4FOO_u7INTEGER'. Taken as a continuation it swallowed the
'' declaration and pasted the NEXT line's first word instead: fb/vector.bi declared
'' 'Vec2fdim' where fbc declares 'Vec2f_', the header then failed to parse at all, and
'' 28 statements went missing from every file that includes it.
''
'' The mangled name is checked here for a second reason: a token the PREPROCESSOR built
'' keeps the location it was expanded at, so the raw spelling read from the source there
'' was the INVOCATION -- four bytes of 'mkfn( Foo )' for a four-byte 'Foo_'.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/mir/src/line-continuation.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: 0 statements not lowered
'' EXPECT-OUT: _Z4FOO_i
'' GOLDEN: expected/line-continuation.out
